===Commissioner of Agriculture===
Incumbent Republican Hugh Weathers ran for re-election against Democratic challenger Tom Elliott, a former [[Richland County, South Carolina|Richland County]] treasurer and councilman.  Neither faced primary opposition.  The major issue in the race was the moving of the state farmers' market, which Elliott suggested had been done improperly.<ref name="Rivals for top South Carolina agriculture job offer ideas to promote farms">{{cite web|url=http://chronicle.augusta.com/news/government/elections/2010-09-18/rivals-top-south-carolina-agriculture-job-offer-ideas-promote|title=Rivals for top South Carolina agriculture job offer ideas to promote farms |work=Augusta Chronicle|date=September 18, 2010 |access-date=December 20, 2012}}</ref>
